{
  "summary": "Reduces log noise for unreachable SOCKS5 proxies and I2P SAM proxies. The initial connection or listen failure is logged as a warning, while repeated subsequent failures are demoted to debug level using LogWarnThenDebug.",
  "problem": "When a configured proxy is unreachable, node logs are repeatedly spammed on every retry: SOCKS5 logs connect failures at info level and I2P repeatedly logs listening failures as errors.",
  "evidence": [
    "PR description: 'Until now every failed attempt logged the connect() failure at info level, and I2P additionally logged \"Couldn't listen\" as an error. Now the first failure is logged as a warning and later ones only at debug level.'",
    "PR description cites consensus in #36759 to adopt LogWarnThenDebug for Tor control connection attempts."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "depends_on": [],
    "enables": ["#36970"]
  },
